      "role": "user",
      "content": "i've already had a guy look at it and he said the mechanics are actually super solid for its age. that's why it's so confusing. i've been sitting here for like three hours and the way it lags right before the hour strikes... it's too consistent to be just \"temperature changes.\" it feels like a code. if we look at the specific intervals when it skips, could we see if they match up with anything major? like big wars or something? i want to see if there's a sequence here.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
